{"seq":1,"slug":"fanout-parallel","title":"BFF 扇出与并行编排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/search-api-bff-performance/aggregation-patterns/fanout-parallel","wordCount":2466,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"bff-扇出与并行编排\">BFF 扇出与并行编排</h1><p>搜索页的一次刷新，在聚合层看来是一张有向无环图：根节点是&quot;组装一次响应&quot;，叶子节点是一个个下游服务。这张图的<strong>形状</strong>——节点间的依赖关系、边上的串并行属性、每一层的宽度——决定了这次请求的延迟下限。而这张图的<strong>执行</strong>——并发度、失败策略、结果归并方式——决定了实际延迟离那个下限有多远。绝大多数&quot;聚合层慢&quot;的案例，问题不在某个下游慢，而在图被画成了串行链。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-扇出图的形状与延迟下限\">核心概念：扇出图的形状与延迟下限</h2><p>把一次搜索聚合拆开看，下游调用天然分成两类。<strong>必需依赖</strong>构成关键路径：没有它就无法返回有意义的响应，比如商品召回、价格与库存。<strong>可选依赖</strong>是增强项：店铺徽章、评价摘要、内容卡片、个性化排序特征——缺了它结果依然可用，只是不够丰富。这个划分不是技术分类，而是<strong>故障策略分类</strong>，后文会反复用到。</p>\n<p>关键路径上如果全是串行调用，理论延迟就是各段之和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>serial</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{serial}} = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">serial</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>而如果这些调用彼此没有数据依赖，可以并行发出，理论延迟变成各段的最大值（忽略排队与连接开销）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>parallel</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{parallel}} = \\max_{i=1}^{n} t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">parallel</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.7596em;vertical-align:-0.7277em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.032em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6306em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7277em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个差别在搜索场景里非常具体。假设召回 40ms、库存 30ms、价格 25ms、促销 35ms、评价摘要 60ms，其中前三项是必需、后两项可选。串行执行是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>190</mn><mtext>ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40+30+25+35+60 = 190\\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">35</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">190</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span></span></span></span></span>；全并行只需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn><mtext>ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max = 60\\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span></span></span></span></span>。三倍的差距，不需要任何单点优化就能拿到。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>拓扑形状</th>\n<th>延迟量级</th>\n<th>下游放大后的表现</th>\n<th>适用条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>纯串行链</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>线性恶化，最脆弱</td>\n<td>有真实数据依赖（B 需要 A 的输出）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>两层 fan-out</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> + 聚合成本</td>\n<td>主要受最慢下游支配</td>\n<td>所有下游独立，最常见的正确形状</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分组并行</td>\n<td>组内 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span></span></span></span></span>、组间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>组数增加时收益递减</td>\n<td>下游有天然的依赖分组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流水线（pipeline）</td>\n<td>受最长阶段支配</td>\n<td>吞吐优先，单次延迟不最优</td>\n<td>批量场景，非单请求</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键判断是：<strong>这条边到底有没有数据依赖？</strong> 常见的伪依赖是把&quot;我需要在同一个函数里拿到两个结果&quot;误当成&quot;第二个调用需要第一个的返回值&quot;。前者用 <code>Promise.all</code> 就够了，后者才需要真串行。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    R[聚合根: 组装搜索结果] --&gt; N1[必需组: 并发发出]&#10;    R --&gt; N2[可选组: 并发发出&lt;br/&gt;带独立短超时]&#10;    N1 --&gt; A[商品召回]&#10;    N1 --&gt; B[价格与库存]&#10;    N1 --&gt; C[促销规则]&#10;    N2 --&gt; D[店铺徽章]&#10;    N2 --&gt; E[评价摘要]&#10;    N2 --&gt; F[内容卡片]&#10;    A --&gt; M{结果归并}&#10;    B --&gt; M&#10;    C --&gt; M&#10;    D --&gt; M&#10;    E --&gt; M&#10;    F --&gt; M&#10;    M --&gt; S[裁剪 + 序列化 + 返回]\">graph TD\n    R[聚合根: 组装搜索结果] --&gt; N1[必需组: 并发发出]\n    R --&gt; N2[可选组: 并发发出&lt;br/&gt;带独立短超时]\n    N1 --&gt; A[商品召回]\n    N1 --&gt; B[价格与库存]\n    N1 --&gt; C[促销规则]\n    N2 --&gt; D[店铺徽章]\n    N2 --&gt; E[评价摘要]\n    N2 --&gt; F[内容卡片]\n    A --&gt; M{结果归并}\n    B --&gt; M\n    C --&gt; M\n    D --&gt; M\n    E --&gt; M\n    F --&gt; M\n    M --&gt; S[裁剪 + 序列化 + 返回]</pre><p>注意可选组和必需组是<strong>并发发出</strong>而不是先后发出的——如果先等必需组回来再发可选组，等于人为把两段串起来，白白多出一次往返。正确做法是两组同时发，但可选组用更短的超时与失败即丢弃的策略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"并发度控制与下游保护\">并发度控制与下游保护</h2><p>&quot;全并行&quot;听起来像是把并发开到无限，但真实系统里并发度是一个需要被显式管理的资源。每个下游服务有自己的连接池容量、线程池大小、限流阈值。聚合层如果对每一个下游调用都无限制地开新连接，结果是在流量高峰时把下游连接池打满，下游开始排队，延迟上升，聚合层因为等待而积压更多请求，形成正反馈。</p>\n<p>并发度控制的落点通常是<strong>每个下游一个信号量（semaphore）</strong>，而不是整个聚合层一个全局上限。理由是不同下游的容量差异很大：商品检索集群可能是几百个节点，评价服务可能只有十几个，对前者开 200 并发是正常的，对后者就是攻击。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"class Downstream {&#10;  constructor(name, { timeoutMs, maxConcurrent }) {&#10;    this.name = name;&#10;    this.timeoutMs = timeoutMs;&#10;    this.semaphore = new Semaphore(maxConcurrent);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  async call(payload) {&#10;    await this.semaphore.acquire();&#10;    try {&#10;      return await withTimeout(this.doCall(payload), this.timeoutMs);&#10;    } finally {&#10;      this.semaphore.release();&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 扇出: 必需组用 fail-fast, 可选组用 fail-soft&#10;const [items, pricing] = await Promise.all([recall.call({ q }), pricing.call({ ids })]);&#10;&#10;const extras = await Promise.allSettled([shop.call({ ids }), reviews.call({ ids }), content.call({ q })]);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Downstream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">timeoutMs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">maxConcurrent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> name;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.timeoutMs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> timeoutMs;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.semaphore </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Semaphore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(maxConcurrent);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  async</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> call</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">payload</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.semaphore.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">acquire</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> withTimeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">doCall</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(payload), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.timeoutMs);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">finally</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.semaphore.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">release</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 扇出: 必需组用 fail-fast, 可选组用 fail-soft</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">items</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pricing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">all</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([recall.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">call</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ q }), pricing.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">call</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ ids })]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> extras</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">allSettled</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([shop.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">call</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ ids }), reviews.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">call</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ ids }), content.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">call</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ q })]);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这段代码里有三个容易被忽略的点。第一，<code>await this.semaphore.acquire()</code> 本身也要有超时，否则下游慢的时候请求会全部堆在等信号量上，此时超时计时还没开始，等于超时保护形同虚设。第二，超时必须包住包括排队在内的整个调用，而不是只包网络往返。第三，<code>Promise.all</code> 与 <code>Promise.allSettled</code> 的混用不是随手写的——必需组用 <code>all</code>（任一失败即整请求失败，快速返回错误页），可选组用 <code>allSettled</code>（收集成功的结果，失败的降级为空），这个选择对应的是上文的故障策略分类。这两个方法的语义差别是规范定义的：<code>Promise.all</code> 在任意一个输入 reject 时立即 reject（fail-fast），而 <code>Promise.allSettled</code> 要等全部 settle 后才 fulfill，并把每个结果标为 <code>fulfilled</code> 或 <code>rejected</code>（来源：MDN <code>Promise.allSettled()</code>, <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Promise/allSettled）。\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Promise/allSettled）。</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"结果归并与部分失败的语义\">结果归并与部分失败的语义</h2><p>并行发出之后要把结果拼成一个响应，这一步的复杂度常被低估。至少有三类问题必须显式回答。</p>\n<p><strong>第一类：下游返回的集合大小不一致。</strong> 召回返回 20 个商品 ID，价格服务对其中 18 个有报价（两个已下架）。归并时是丢弃这两个、还是保留但标记为无货？这个决定是产品语义而不是技术细节，必须由契约明确，不能靠&quot;哪个服务先返回就用哪个&quot;的偶然行为。</p>\n<p><strong>第二类：字段级的部分成功。</strong> 权衡的粒度可能不是整个下游，而是单个字段。20 个商品里 18 个有价格，如果因为 2 个缺失就丢弃整个价格字段，用户看到的是&quot;全部商品都没价&quot;——这比&quot;两个商品显示待询价&quot;糟糕得多。字段级归并的伪代码：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"function mergeField(items, partial, key, fallback) {&#10;  for (const item of items) {&#10;    const v = partial.get(item.id);&#10;    item[key] = v === undefined ? fallback : v;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> mergeField</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">items</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">partial</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">fallback</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> item</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> items) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> partial.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(item.id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    item[key] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> undefined</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fallback </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>第三类：失败的可观测性。</strong> 降级不能是静默的。每一次可选下游失败都要打点（下游名、错误类别、耗时、是否为超时），否则你会看到&quot;接口延迟正常但转化率掉了&quot;，却不知道是评价摘要一直在悄悄失败导致卡片变空。降级的监控口径属于测量基础设施，本 hub 只强调&quot;降级必须留痕&quot;这一条契约。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>失败范围</th>\n<th>推荐语义</th>\n<th>用户可见后果</th>\n<th>是否计入错误率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>必需下游全失败</td>\n<td>返回错误页/空状态</td>\n<td>明确告知无法搜索</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>必需下游部分超时</td>\n<td>重试一次 + 部分结果</td>\n<td>结果减少</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可选下游失败</td>\n<td>静默降级 + 留痕</td>\n<td>卡片缺该模块</td>\n<td>否，但计入降级率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字段级缺失</td>\n<td>填默认值</td>\n<td>单项显示待定</td>\n<td>否，计入字段覆盖率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"超时预算的分配与去重\">超时预算的分配与去重</h2><p>扇出图上的每个调用都要有超时，而且这些超时不能各自拍脑袋定。正确做法是从<strong>入口的总预算</strong>往回分配：假设这次搜索请求的端到端预算是 300ms，序列化与网络返回留 30ms，聚合逻辑留 20ms，那么下游调用分到 250ms。必需组的超时不能超过 250ms（否则它自己就成了超预算的那个），可选组的超时必须明显更短——因为可选组是在&quot;必需组已经回来&quot;的期望时间点之前发出的，它真正能用的窗口是 250ms 减去必需组耗时，但按最大值规划会让它几乎没窗口。实践中的做法是给可选组一个固定的短超时（例如 80ms），到点即弃。</p>\n<p>超时预算的完整传播机制——包括调用链上每一跳如何递减、如何与上游的 deadline 对齐——是一个独立且重要的话题，见 <a href=\"../caching-degradation/deadline-propagation\">超时预算与截止时间传播</a>。本文只强调扇出层的两个具体约束：<strong>并发扇出时所有分支共享同一个 deadline</strong>（不能每个分支从自己发起时开始计时，否则最晚发出的分支总预算最长，等于没有预算），以及<strong>排队等待信号量的时间计入超时</strong>。</p>\n<p>去重是扇出图上另一个廉价但高回报的优化。同一次请求里，两个不同的卡片组件可能都需要&quot;这批商品的店铺信息&quot;，如果各自独立发一次调用，下游看到的就是两次相同请求。在请求作用域内做一次 memo（key 为下游名 + 参数签名）就能消除。这和字段级的批处理是同一类思路的不同层次——本系列的另一篇 <a href=\"nplus1-graphql\">聚合字段的 n+1 问题与 DataLoader</a> 讨论的是如何把&quot;逐条调用&quot;聚合成&quot;批量调用&quot;，而请求内去重解决的是&quot;同一个批量调用被发了两遍&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>扇出图的关键路径由<strong>必需依赖</strong>决定，可选依赖必须从关键路径上摘出去并发执行。</li>\n<li>并行的理论收益是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>→</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum t_i \\to \\max t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，在搜索场景里通常是 3 倍量级，且不需要任何单点优化。</li>\n<li>并发度要<strong>按下游</strong>设信号量上限，且信号量排队时间必须计入超时。</li>\n<li>必需组用 fail-fast，可选组用 fail-soft（<code>Promise.all</code> vs <code>Promise.allSettled</code>），这个选择由故障策略分类决定，不能随手写。</li>\n<li>归并要处理集合大小不一致、字段级部分成功、降级留痕三个问题，其中字段级归并是保证卡片不&quot;整块缺失&quot;的关键。</li>\n<li>超时预算从入口总预算往回分配，扇出分支共享同一 deadline，可选分支用固定短超时。</li>\n<li>请求内去重消除&quot;同一批量调用发两遍&quot;，它与跨条目的批处理（见 <a href=\"nplus1-graphql\">n+1 与 DataLoader</a>）是两个不同层次的优化。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>决定了扇出形状之后，&quot;返回多少字段、以什么粒度返回&quot;成为下一个决定因素，见 <a href=\"api-contract\">搜索 API 契约：字段裁剪与按需返回</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"BFF 扇出与并行编排","id":"bff-扇出与并行编排"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：扇出图的形状与延迟下限","id":"核心概念-扇出图的形状与延迟下限"},{"level":2,"text":"并发度控制与下游保护","id":"并发度控制与下游保护"},{"level":2,"text":"结果归并与部分失败的语义","id":"结果归并与部分失败的语义"},{"level":2,"text":"超时预算的分配与去重","id":"超时预算的分配与去重"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"聚合字段的 n+1 问题与 DataLoader","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/search-api-bff-performance/aggregation-patterns/nplus1-graphql"}}